#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/1-robot_descriptions.md:12
#: d8b98ce059b34d0ba310965fef54cb3c
msgid ""
"Description-side Cursor skills: **`feature/agilex` only** (`split-chassis-"
"glb`) — [Add a Robot](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md). "
"**`main` has no `.cursor/skills`**. Newer AgileX / Rokae INEX rows: [README "
"on `feature/agilex`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/README.md). **Taku** is in-tree "
"on that branch at `humanoid/Dyna/taku_description` ([package "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md));"
" it is not on `main` and is not a row in that branch’s brand tables."
msgstr ""
"描述侧 Cursor skill：**仅 `feature/agilex`**（`split-chassis-glb`）— "
"[添加机器人](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md)。**`main` 没有 "
"`.cursor/skills`**。更新的 AgileX / 珞石 INEX "
"行：[README（`feature/agilex`）](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/README.md)。**Taku** 在该分支仓内 "
"`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`（[包 README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)）；不在"
" `main` 上，也不是该分支品牌表中的一行。"

